<title>USA: AIM fund firm says tops $50 bln in assets.</title>
<headline>AIM fund firm says tops $50 bln in assets.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>AIM Distributors Inc, the retail marketing arm of AIM Management Group Inc, said it has topped the $50 billion mark in retail fund net assets under management.</p>
<p>AIM said Strategic Insight, a research firm, has ranked it 12th among mutual fund companies in net assets under management.</p>
<p>AIM merged with Invesco Plc last month.</p>
